# hw definition file for processing by chibios_hwdef.py
# Bidirectional DShot version of Roban-X2A (CKS32F407): same board ID and bootloader.
# Outputs 9 and 11 (TIM4_CH1/CH3, DMA1 S0/S7) read RPM back from the ESC;
# the main ESC (HeliRSC) goes on output 9, a DDFP tail ESC on 11. TIM4_CH2
# shares DMA1 S3 with SPI2_RX and TIM4_CH4 has no DMA on F4, so outputs
# 10/12 stay plain DShot/PWM. DShot on any of 9-12
# turns the whole TIM4 group (9-12) to DShot.

include ../Roban-X2A/hwdef.dat

undef PD12 PD13 PD14 PD15

PD12 TIM4_CH1 TIM4 PWM(9)  GPIO(58) BIDIR
PD13 TIM4_CH2 TIM4 PWM(10) GPIO(59)
PD14 TIM4_CH3 TIM4 PWM(11) GPIO(60) BIDIR
PD15 TIM4_CH4 TIM4 PWM(12) GPIO(61)

# TIM4 shares DMA1 S0/S7 with I2C1/I2C2 (the F4 I2C driver needs DMA, so an
# exclusive TIM4 allocation does not build); give TIM4 priority instead.
DMA_PRIORITY TIM4*
